My mother and my father are on the laptop screen.
They are very happy.
Mother smiles and asks, "Maya, how are you?"
I say, "I am fine, Mom."
I ask Dad, "Dad, how are you?"
Dad says, "We are fine here."
I take my laptop in my hand.
I turn the laptop slowly.
I say excitedly, "Look, this is my room!"
There is a bed and a table in the room.
Mother looks at the screen.
She says, "Your room is very beautiful."
A man is speaking loudly outside.
Dad asks, "Who is there?"
I laugh and say, "That is a vegetable vendor."
Dad says, "Your room is really very nice."
My parents are happy seeing my new room.
